All infiltration options in ResStock are provided in air changes per hour (ACH) at 50 Pascals, as calculated by a blower door test. The characteristic sets the \texttt{air\_leakage\_leakiness\_description}, \texttt{air\_leakage\_units}, \texttt{air\_leakage\_house\_pressure}, \texttt{air\_leakage\_value}, \texttt{air\_leakage\_type}, and \texttt{site\_shielding\_of\_home} ResStock arguments. For the argument definitions, see Table \ref{table:hc_arg_def_infil}. See the OpenStudio-HPXML \href{https://openstudio-hpxml.readthedocs.io/en/v1.10.0/workflow_inputs.html##hpxml-site}{Site} documentation for the available HPXML schema elements, default values, and constraints.

